    "catalog:format": "2",
    "catalog:tags": "shower tray, shower, bathroom",
    "catalog:note": "Shower tray: a rim upstand 0.055 wide, its outer corners rounded to radius 0.05 and its inner corners to radius 0.03, drawn as one outline sweep less the opening (0.79 x 0.79), an outline sweep cut through it; inside it a floor plate 0.025 thick, an outline sweep with a round cut through it, and the gully grating set in the cut, flush with the floor; plate and grating stand 0.001 clear of the rim and the cut. The floor is flat; its falls to the gully are drawn in plan only. rim 0.04.",
    "catalog:basedOn": "Drafting standard key dimensions (0.90 x 0.90 x 0.04, practice; EN 14527), not read, unverified; corner radius 0.05, inner corner radius 0.03, rim width 0.055, floor 0.025, gully radius 0.044: author's sizes, unverified; ports BS EN 12056-2 via the drafting standard, not read, unverified",
    "ifc:class": "IfcSanitaryTerminal",
    "ifc:predefinedType": "SHOWER",
    "ifcClass": "IfcSanitaryTerminal",
    "mat:rim": "ceramic",
    "mat:floorPlate": "ceramic",
    "mat:gully": "metal"
  },
